{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732480/extras/c985a4d699fd7509ea9719c13b92314d.avif?t=1772110750\" width=450 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world on the brink of extinction, where the last human colonies endure the relentless assault of robots corrupted by an ancient virus. Lug, a young villager, fights to protect his people in a land ruled by despair. After a mysterious earthquake, his fate is forever changed when he discovers powerful energy crystals that connect him to the consciousness of his long-lost mother and to the Vital Thread, the force that binds all life on the planet.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732480/extras/7fb29400778843f203c2613f7d42bba9.poster.avif?t=1772110750\" width=1170 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732480/extras/7fb29400778843f203c2613f7d42bba9.webm?t=1772110750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732480/extras/7fb29400778843f203c2613f7d42bba9.mp4?t=1772110750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a stunning voxel-art world brimming with life and secrets, engage in fast-paced real-time battles against relentless mechanoids, and tackle clever puzzles that challenge both your wits and courage. Every choice will drag you closer to a defining dilemma: save the robots at the cost of all organic life, or forge a fragile balance where both can coexist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The fate of the world rests on whether Lug can break the cycle of hatred and choose a new future for all.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732480/extras/f90a0df64023f749d181ffe514d21b3c.avif?t=1772110750\" width=316 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAST-PACED AND VARIED COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time combat where you can use different weapons, skills, magic and items.  <br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732480/extras/17cb74a32bb0d212fa423346afa40016.poster.avif?t=1772110750\" width=1170 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732480/extras/17cb74a32bb0d212fa423346afa40016.webm?t=1772110750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732480/extras/17cb74a32bb0d212fa423346afa40016.mp4?t=1772110750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE YOUR CHARACTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find different weapons that you can upgrade and evolve, amulets, and all kinds of items that will make you more powerful. <br>      <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732480/extras/48d4a0b8df16955adbc74334f930cefb.poster.avif?t=1772110750\" width=1170 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732480/extras/48d4a0b8df16955adbc74334f930cefb.webm?t=1772110750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732480/extras/48d4a0b8df16955adbc74334f930cefb.mp4?t=1772110750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLASSIC RPG PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every true warrior must strengthen both their body and mind.   <br>    <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732480/extras/a7bb0520a1836478ba8ed932e07de8c6.poster.avif?t=1772110750\" width=1170 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732480/extras/a7bb0520a1836478ba8ed932e07de8c6.webm?t=1772110750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732480/extras/a7bb0520a1836478ba8ed932e07de8c6.mp4?t=1772110750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SEMILINEAR WORLD WITH GATED PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain new powers to progress through different areas. <br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732480/extras/e151d186b73f02e1c55ea733fad2fd0e.poster.avif?t=1772110750\" width=1170 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732480/extras/e151d186b73f02e1c55ea733fad2fd0e.webm?t=1772110750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732480/extras/e151d186b73f02e1c55ea733fad2fd0e.mp4?t=1772110750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The fate of the planet is in your hands. Can you change it?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2732480?t=1772110750","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732480/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772110750","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732480/cdc68ec46b45fb9c5b69a4fcb1c2e779e8a53421/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772110750","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732480/cdc68ec46b45fb9c5b69a4fcb1c2e779e8a53421/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772110750","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2942570,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732480/extras/c985a4d699fd7509ea9719c13b92314d.avif?t=1772110750\" width=450 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world on the brink of extinction, where the last human colonies endure the relentless assault of robots corrupted by an ancient virus. Lug, a young villager, fights to protect his people in a land ruled by despair. After a mysterious earthquake, his fate is forever changed when he discovers powerful energy crystals that connect him to the consciousness of his long-lost mother and to the Vital Thread, the force that binds all life on the planet.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2732480/extras/7fb29400778843f203c2613f7d42bba9.poster.avif?t=1772110750\" width=1170 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.